{"id":"torrey:christ-the-high-priest","source":"torrey","name":"Christ, The High Priest","slug":"christ-the-high-priest","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Appointed and called by God — Heb 3:1,2; 5:4,5.","refs":[["Heb",3,1,3,1],["Heb",3,2,3,2],["Heb",5,4,5,4],["Heb",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"After the order of Melchizedek — Ps 110:4; Heb 5:6; 6:20; 7:15,17.","refs":[["Ps",110,4,110,4],["Heb",5,6,5,6],["Heb",6,20,6,20],["Heb",7,15,7,15],["Heb",7,17,7,17]]},{"text":"Superior to Aaron and the Levitical priests — Heb 7:11,16,22; 8:1,2,6.","refs":[["Heb",7,11,7,11],["Heb",7,16,7,16],["Heb",7,22,7,22],["Heb",8,1,8,1],["Heb",8,2,8,2],["Heb",8,6,8,6]]},{"text":"Consecrated with an oath — Heb 7:20,21.","refs":[["Heb",7,20,7,20],["Heb",7,21,7,21]]},{"text":"Has an unchangeable priesthood — Heb 7:23,28.","refs":[["Heb",7,23,7,23],["Heb",7,28,7,28]]},{"text":"Is of unblemished purity — Heb 7:26,28.","refs":[["Heb",7,26,7,26],["Heb",7,28,7,28]]},{"text":"Faithful — Heb 3:2.","refs":[["Heb",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Needed no sacrifice for himself — Heb 7:27.","refs":[["Heb",7,27,7,27]]},{"text":"Offered himself a sacrifice — Heb 9:14,26.","refs":[["Heb",9,14,9,14],["Heb",9,26,9,26]]},{"text":"His sacrifice superior to all others — Heb 9:13,14,23.","refs":[["Heb",9,13,9,13],["Heb",9,14,9,14],["Heb",9,23,9,23]]},{"text":"Offered sacrifice but once — Heb 7:27; 9:25,26.","refs":[["Heb",7,27,7,27],["Heb",9,25,9,25],["Heb",9,26,9,26]]},{"text":"Made reconciliation — Heb 2:17.","refs":[["Heb",2,17,2,17]]},{"text":"Obtained redemption for us — Heb 9:12.","refs":[["Heb",9,12,9,12]]},{"text":"Entered into heaven — Heb 4:14; 10:12.","refs":[["Heb",4,14,4,14],["Heb",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"Sympathises with those who are tempted — Heb 2:18; 4:15.","refs":[["Heb",2,18,2,18],["Heb",4,15,4,15]]},{"text":"Intercedes — Heb 7:25; 9:24.","refs":[["Heb",7,25,7,25],["Heb",9,24,9,24]]},{"text":"Blesses — Nu 6:23-26; Ac 3:26.","refs":[["Num",6,23,6,26],["Acts",3,26,3,26]]},{"text":"On his throne — Zec 6:13.","refs":[["Zech",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Appointment of, and encouragement to steadfastness — Heb 4:14.","refs":[["Heb",4,14,4,14]]},{"text":"Melchizedek. — Ge 14:18-20.","refs":[["Gen",14,18,14,20]]},{"text":"Aaron, &c. — Ex 40:12-15.","refs":[["Exod",40,12,40,15]]}],"refCount":45}
